# Mount the scenario's custom dir read-only into the single customization
# mount point (docs/common.md, "The Custom Directory"). Contains
# nginx/proxy/api.conf (exact "<key>.conf" legacy naming — included by the
# normal render, no bridge) and nginx/proxy/api_v2.prefix.conf (dotted name
# for api_v2 that also matches the old "api*.conf" glob — the legacy bridge
# includes it into the api location as well, with a warning).
-v "${SCENARIO_DIR}/files/custom":/container/custom:ro
